      "start_seconds": 12.83,
      "end_seconds": 27.2,
      "duration_seconds": 14.37,
      "text": "Mainly constipation. There's a couple of other things uh but that's the main one. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
